  "img": "icons/skills/trades/construction-mason-bricklayer-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>By means of engineering, or perhaps a certain species of plant, you have constructed a makeshift rowboat with a set of oars, the stats of which are found in Chapter 4: Equipments and Items, in the Mounts and Vehicles Section. The boat lasts 24 hours.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you use this creation using a creation slot of 3rd level, the boat lasts 1 week. With a slot of 4th level, the boat lasts 1 month. With a 5th level slot, the boat lasts until it is destroyed.</p>",
